# LF everywhere.
#
# Half this team is on Windows and git was already warning that it would rewrite the whole tree to
# CRLF on the first commit from that machine. That turns every later diff into a whole-file diff,
# and it breaks newline-anchored edits in tooling — a failure this estate has hit repeatedly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are compared byte-for-byte against sentences the backend produced. A line-ending
# rewrite in one of those is a silent behaviour change inside a test.
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
